{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"f271617c-95a8-4693-a698-34c857008d7a","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented a fix to prevent the entire system prompt from being re‑sent on each `save_fact` call.\n\n### Key Change\n- **`bot.py`**\n  - Updated `build_system` to separate the static instructions from the dynamic athlete context.\n  - Returns two messages:\n    1. Static `INSTRUCTIONS` (cacheable).\n    2. Dynamic athlete context marked as `ephemeral`.\n\n### Details\n- This allows the static portion to be cached, avoiding full‑prompt charges on memory writes.\n- Only the per‑athlete context is sent as `ephemeral`, keeping updates lightweight.\n\nYou can review the exact modifications and rationale in the generated **[ANSWER.md](/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/f271617c-95a8-4693-a698-34c857008d7a/ANSWER.md)**.\n","duration_seconds":27.144803,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":15840,"output_tokens":2029,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":81664,"total_tokens":17869}}}
